53:["$","p",null,{"className":"my-5 leading-8 text-foreground/85","children":[["$","$1","0",{"children":"官方电报频道是 @amytelecom_official，故障、维护和补偿都在这里发。另外官方上线了测试中的电报机器人 @amytele_bot，打开后发送 "}],["$","$1","1",{"children":["$","code",null,{"className":"border border-rule bg-card px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[0.85em] text-accent","children":"/login"}]}],["$","$1","2",{"children":" 绑定账号，可以查流量、加入私有频道、获取订阅链接。另有一个服务状态页 amytelecom.statuspage.io。"}]]}]
